[
  {
    "content_id": "10065001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;耶稣基督的仆人，雅各的弟兄犹大，写信给那被召、在父　神里蒙爱、为耶稣基督保守的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;愿怜恤、平安、慈爱多多地加给你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的弟兄啊，我想尽心写信给你们，论我们同得救恩的时候，就不得不写信劝你们，要为从前一次交付圣徒的真道竭力地争辩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;因为有些人偷着进来，就是自古被定受刑罚的，是不虔诚的，将我们　神的恩变作放纵情欲的机会，并且不认独一的主宰—我们主耶稣基督。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;从前主救了他的百姓出埃及地，后来就把那些不信的灭绝了。这一切的事，你们虽然都知道，我却仍要提醒你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;又有不守本位、离开自己住处的天使，主用锁链把他们永远拘留在黑暗里，等候大日的审判。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;又如所多玛、蛾摩拉和周围城邑的人，也照他们一味地行淫，随从逆性的情欲，就受永火的刑罚，作为鉴戒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;这些作梦的人也像他们污秽身体，轻慢主治的，毁谤在尊位的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;天使长米迦勒为摩西的尸首与魔鬼争辩的时候，尚且不敢用毁谤的话罪责他，只说：「主责备你吧！」。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;但这些人毁谤他们所不知道的。他们本性所知道的事与那没有灵性的畜类一样，在这事上竟败坏了自己。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;他们有祸了！因为走了该隐的道路，又为利往巴兰的错谬里直奔，并在可拉的背叛中灭亡了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;这样的人在你们的爱席上与你们同吃的时候，正是礁石。他们作牧人，只知喂养自己，无所惧怕；是没有雨的云彩，被风飘荡；是秋天没有果子的树，死而又死，连根被拔出来；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;是海里的狂浪，涌出自己可耻的沫子来；是流荡的星，有墨黑的幽暗为他们永远存留。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;亚当的七世孙以诺曾预言这些人说：「看哪，主带着他的千万圣者降临，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;要在众人身上行审判，证实那一切不敬虔的人所妄行一切不敬虔的事，又证实不敬虔之罪人所说顶撞他的刚愎话。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;这些人是私下议论，常发怨言的，随从自己的情欲而行，口中说夸大的话，为得便宜谄媚人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的弟兄啊，你们要记念我们主耶稣基督之使徒从前所说的话。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;他们曾对你们说过，末世必有好讥诮的人随从自己不敬虔的私欲而行。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;这就是那些引人结党、属乎血气、没有圣灵的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的弟兄啊，你们却要在至圣的真道上造就自己，在圣灵里祷告，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;保守自己常在　神的爱中，仰望我们主耶稣基督的怜悯，直到永生。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;有些人存疑心，你们要怜悯他们；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;有些人你们要从火中抢出来，搭救他们；有些人你们要存惧怕的心怜悯他们，连那被情欲沾染的衣服也当厌恶。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;那能保守你们不失脚、叫你们无瑕无疵、欢欢喜喜站在他荣耀之前的我们的救主—独一的　神，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;愿荣耀、威严、能力、权柄，因我们的主耶稣基督归与他，从万古以前并现今，直到永永远远。阿们！</p>"
  }
]